---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---
<Legal title="Refund and cancellation policy" description="How to cancel a FlutterProbe subscription and how refunds work.">
  <h2>Cancel any time</h2>
  <p>You can cancel your subscription at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period, and you keep access until then.</p>

  <h2>Full refund within 14 days</h2>
  <p>If you ask within 14 days of a charge, we refund that charge in full, no questions asked.</p>

  <h2>After 14 days</h2>
  <p>When you cancel after the first 14 days, we refund the unused part of the current billing period on a pro-rata basis.</p>

  <h2>Metered usage</h2>
  <p>Usage that is billed by the unit (for example relay minutes) is billable as it is used. It is refundable only when we billed it in error.</p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Refunds go back to the original payment method. Payments are processed by Stripe, and your bank may take a few business days to show the refund.</p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">support@alphawavesystems.com</a> from the email address of your account and tell us which charge you mean.</p>
</Legal>
